        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The dragon breathes a blast of flame that deals @Damage[9d6[fire]|options:area-damage] damage in a @Template[type:cone|distance:40] (@Check[reflex|dc:29|basic|options:area-effect] save). Creatures that critically fail their save catch fire, taking @Damage[2d6[persistent,fire]] damage. The area then fills with black smoke for 1 minute. This has the effects of mist, except it fills the cone's area. The dragon can't use Pyre Breath again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Pyre Breath]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>",
